{"unit_id": "tag:01QJ:statement", "translation": "在情形<REF_0001>中。\n设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。\n令<MATH_0003>为分次（graded）<MATH_0004>-模（module）。\n存在同构（isomorphisms）\n<MATH_0005>\n它们关于<MATH_0006>具有函子性（functorial），并使得\n<MATH_0007>\n为恒等映射（identity map）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性"}, {"source_term": "identity map", "target_term": "恒等映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "描述所给层的拟凝聚性。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "描述所设模的分次结构。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指指定标量对象上的模。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指引理断言存在的同构。"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性", "context": "描述同构关于指定对象的函子性。"}, {"source_term": "identity map", "target_term": "恒等映射", "context": "指引理中指定映射须等于的恒等映射。"}], "notes": []}
